      "writtenOn": "2023-09-07T17:22:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think you should set a default log level and we should only actually mark the disable logs for verbose entries.\n\n```\n// Log all D-Bus at verbose level. For especially verbose calls and callbacks, this needs to be explicitly disabled.\nconst DEFAULT_DBUS_LOGGING_CONFIG \u003d DbusLog::Enable(DbusLogOptions::LogAll, DbusLogVerbosity::Verbose);\n\nlet dbus_method_name \u003d meta_list.nested[0].clone();\nlet dbus_logging \u003d if meta_list.nested.len() \u003e 1 {\n  meta_list.nested[1].clone()\n} else {\n  DEFAULT_DBUS_LOGGING_CONFIG.clone()\n}\n```",
      "revId": "2161651b771ed62aabe5268f7f5b6d24e7fee6b0",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
